# Lint and diagnostics

- Do **not** run `read_lints`, IDE lint tasks, or similar lint/diagnostic checks on your own after edits or as part of routine work.
- Only run lint or surface diagnostics when the user **explicitly** asks to check lint, fix lints, or verify diagnostics in that conversation.

This applies in every chat and context window unless the user overrides it in their message.
